*> vybe-test: cobol/data_group_level/data_group_modify_elementary_field
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_data_group_level.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 RECORD.
   05 CODE PIC X(2) VALUE "AA".
   05 VALUE-FIELD PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "BB" TO CODE.
    MOVE 9999 TO VALUE-FIELD.
    DISPLAY CODE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING CODE DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "BB"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [BB] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY VALUE-FIELD.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING VALUE-FIELD DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "9999"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [9999] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

